## nexus

This project is a Jolt port of [nexus](https://github.com/cjohansen/nexus),
commit `5f6c93672f25d2a5b2a91ac3b65a921ecf8826b2`, by Christian Johansen,
Magnar Sveen, and Teodor Heggelund. Extracted from
[jlt-commons/glitter](https://github.com/jlt-commons/glitter), where it
first landed as `glitter.nexus`/`glitter.nexus.registry` — this project
carries forward that same port, renamed to match upstream's own
namespace names now that it stands alone.

