- `src/nexus/core.clj` — `glitter.nexus`, originally `src/nexus/core.cljc`
  in upstream nexus. One deviation, carried over unchanged from the
  glitter port: the three `#?(:clj Exception :cljs :default)`
  reader-conditionals collapse to a plain `Exception` catch (Jolt only,
  no cljs).
- `src/nexus/registry.clj` — `glitter.nexus.registry`, originally
  `src/nexus/registry.cljc` in upstream nexus. Byte-for-byte port, no
  adaptations.
